 okay so um  we don't have you know we're just  kind of trying to put it all together uh  here  and  just to note that our guppies is open to  everybody we really look for  international members  um and just anybody who's interested in  uh you know r used in either the  government or with official statistics  or  you know government data or what have  you  uh the interagency our users group is  still going to continue  and we think that group will  be more government folks because  the  this group will maybe wrestle with  issues  that would  only be of interest say to somebody  who's uh you know a good government  employee  so you know how do we get through the  the it regulations and and that type of  thing  uh so we're really trying to solicit  ideas for our buddies uh we haven't had  a meeting yet our first one we're going  to try to have in january  and hopefully that one will  kind of solicit ideas for  what we might do in the future  we're hoping that uh local groups of our  governs can form local meaning  geographically or maybe by areas of  interest  and we're uh thinking about uh maybe  having the our guvies  sort of sponsor if you would on our  consortium working group  and some of the ideas for that  are listed here  so i hope you get involved uh feel free  to contact me for information on any of  these  um things our govies the interagency our  users group or even just our bls efforts  using r
 

